        "Content": "- Property benefits from several improvements, renovations and extensions over the years \r\n- Garage with electricity, providing useful storage/workspace.Carport offering additional covered space.\r\n- Double glazed windows with an added porch \r\n- Spacious rear garden with mature planting for privacy\r\n- Walking distance to village amenities, including shops, post office, chemist, cafés, pubs, takeaway and community facilities.\r\n- Walking distance to Scoil Bhríde primary school and Saplings Special School.\r\n- 10 minutes from Bagenalstown Train Station, with services on the Dublin–Waterford line.\r\n- Scope for further modernisation or extension, subject to the necessary planning requirements.\r\nServices : Oil fired central heating, open fire, mains water and mains waste."
